8_scaled.safetensors\n│   ├── 📂 vae/\n│   │   └── qwen_image_vae.safetensors\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: Model link", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [553.9473876953125, 782.71923828125], "pos": [-1866.386962890625, 572.8624267578125], "id": 143, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [242, 244], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["Cinematic ultra-detailed RAW photography of an elegant woman sitting gracefully on the wet, moss-covered stone steps of an ancient Jiangnan water town. She wears a meticulously tailored dark emerald silk qipao, subtly embroidered with silver thread depicting delicate bamboo leaves, the luxurious fabric clinging slightly to her flawless silhouette in the damp, heavy air. She gazes profoundly into the unseen distance, her subtle micro-expressions conveying a profound sense of quiet melancholy and timeless longing. An extreme low-angle shot, positioned mere inches above the slick, time-worn cobblestones, establishes powerful visual leading lines, using the converging edges of the wet stone staircase and the curving dark canal to forcefully draw the viewer's eye directly toward her contemplative expression. A continuous soft drizzle falls from an overcast twilight sky, creating tiny mesmerizing splashes on the ink-black water and leaving delicate moisture droplets on her porcelain skin and the fine silk of her dress. The scene is immersed in an intensely moody, dark tonal palette of deep shadowy cyans, rich charcoals, and cool teals, punctuated only by the faint, diffuse warm amber glow of distant traditional paper lanterns reflecting off the rain-slicked masonry, creating a striking interplay of light and shadow. Masterful spatial depth is meticulously achieved through dramatic foreground framing, where out-of-focus wet stones and glistening ferns blur at the extreme bottom edges. The midground features the intricate weathered wooden facades and arched stone bridges of the town, while the background gracefully fades into a heavy, atmospheric aerial perspective of dense mist and rain. Cinematic Rembrandt lighting lightly sculpts her delicate facial features, contrasting sharply with deep ambient occlusion in the architectural crevices. Captured on a Hasselblad H6D-100c with an ultra-wide 14mm lens to emphasize the low-angle perspective, 8k resolution, extreme shallow depth of field, hyper-photorealistic rendering, Octane Render, V-Ray, award-winning dramatic lighting, unparalleled atmospheric storytelling, absolute masterpiece visual fidelity."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 143, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 229, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [416.2719421386719, 151.10955810546875], "pos": [-296.0504150390625, 812.3875732421875], "id": 5, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.73", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 26}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [212, 282], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [204.134765625, 26], "pos": [-65.13038635253906, 1017.2841186523438], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "conditioning", "link": 242, "label": "conditioning", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "conditioning"}], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "id": 16, "type": "ConditioningZeroOut", "properties": {"cn