 natural focus, creating a sense of depth and airy atmosphere. The composition is balanced using the rule of thirds, with the woman positioned slightly to the right to allow the river and the expansive horizon to breathe. The lighting is bright and natural, casting soft shadows beneath her and the items, highlighting the crisp textures of the fabric and the fur of the cat. The overall aesthetic is one of leisure, serenity, and feminine grace, captured with professional photography standards that emphasize a shallow depth of field, keeping the subject in sharp detail while the distant river bank gently fades into the bright light of the day. Every element, from the delicate lace straps of her top to the metallic glint of the soda cans and the precise fold of the picnic blanket, is rendered with absolute clarity and artistic precision, evoking a warm, idyllic summer afternoon vibe that celebrates both the scenic landscape and the undeniable, voluminous beauty of the woman."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "Text Multiline", "title": "提示词", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#255725", "size": [453.2653503417969, 570.8272705078125], "pos": [154.51487731933594, -60.38313674926758], "id": 163, "properties": {"cnr_id": "pr-was-node-suite-comfyui-47064894", "ver": "ea935d1044ae5a26efa54ebeb18fe9020af49a45", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "parameters", "links": [319], "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}], "size": [352.50152587890625, 346], "pos": [-1270.322509765625, 168.86972045898438], "widgets_values": [4096, 30, 0.9, 0.05, 1, 0.8, 1, 0, 1, 0, 0.1, 5, -1], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "max_tokens"}, "name": "max_tokens", "label": "max_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "top_k"}, "name": "top_k", 